      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Hugh Morris Alliance Auctioneers are delighted to present number 12 Swiftbrook Glen to the market. Swiftbrook Glen is one of Virginia`s most desirable residential developments offering privacy and a welcoming quietness. An exquisite large, detached family home located on the cusp of Virginia town extending to approximately 180sq.m. \r\n\r\nThe home is nicely located in the heart of the development on a much sought after large corner plot of approx. 0.32 acre. With the added benefit of overlooking a large green area to the front of the property.\r\n\r\nFrom entering through the front door this home offers ample amounts of natural light to floods through the house. From the hallway the door to left leads into the spacious family living room with built in stove. The large open plan kitchen offers an abundance of light with eye to floor units with a large island with integrated hob and extractor overhead. The adjoining conservatory acts as a second sitting room offering an additional space in the home to relax in the evening. The conservatory benefits from a triple aspect, allowing the natural light to pour in.  There is also a rear vaulted extension that is integrated into the kitchen area as your dining room. With double patio doors that lead to the rear patio area and a well-maintained garden.\r\n\r\nAs you head upstairs to the landing, there are four well maintained spacious bedrooms offering any buyer the joy of just moving directly into this home. The master bedroom situated at the front of the home has an en-suite and fitted wardrobe. The family bathroom is tastefully designing with a lovely free-standing bath and shower. The home accommodation consists of entrance hall, spacious living room, large kitchen/living room with the dining room situated within the extension, utility room and guest w.c. completing the ground floor. On the first floor is the landing, 4 good-sized bedrooms, master bedroom and a family bedroom. \r\n\r\nExternally the property sits on a large corner plot size of approx. 0.32 acres with a spacious side garden, rear patio area and private gated entrance. There is a tarmacadam driveway into the house and along one side of the home offering ample parking. At the front of the home there is wall and railings right round the perimeter of the home with gated access. At the rear of the house is a well presented large sweeping patio area, storage shed, fenced on the right side for privacy and landscaped garden. The garden benefits from mature shrubbery around the perimeter. The rear garden is a South facing orientation giving sunlight through-out most of the day.  \r\n\r\n\r\nLocation:\r\nSwiftbrook Glen is a much sought after development within the town of Virginia. Within walking distance of the heart of the town, this home offers its new owner’s easy access to all its amenities. \r\n\r\nVirginia is a historic town in County Cavan and is located on the shores of Lough Ramor along the N3 Dublin–Cavan Road. Virginia has a host of amenities such as Schools, Churches, Restaurants, Café, beautiful lake locations, sporting clubs – Ramor GAA, Virginia Rugby Club, Eagles basketball, Ramor watersports, Golf Course and much more. Deerpark Forest walk can be access directly across the main road beside Virginia Rugby club. \r\nThere are regular transport links from Virginia to other major towns such as Cavan, Navan and Dublin via bus or car. This home offers the perfect blend of convenience and tranquillity."
      },
